    "body": "It appears that Traccar phones home by default with the setting in `default.xml`.\r\n\r\n```xml\r\n<entry key='server.statistics'>https://www.traccar.org/analytics/</entry>\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is not documented for the [configuration file](https://www.traccar.org/configuration-file/); there is just a short mention [in a forum post](https://www.traccar.org/forums/topic/analytics/).\r\n\r\nIt appears the full server statistics is uploaded to the specified URL every day. \r\n\r\nI feel that this should definitely not be enabled by default.",
